{"id":"a09ec8a13786db93","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-hyperimmune-principal.md","title":"集合超免疫性与主函数不可支配","display":"thm-hyperimmune-principal — 集合超免疫性与主函数不可支配","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-hyperimmune-principal","aliases":["43-thm-hyperimmune-principal"],"display":"thm-hyperimmune-principal — 集合超免疫性与主函数不可支配","depends_on":["[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]","[[43-df-principal-function]]","[[43-df-domination]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.14, argument around Lemma 5.14.4 and Theorem 5.14.5","source_printed_pages":"59","source_pdf_pages":"79","source_scope":"book-derived","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-hyperimmune-principal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-hyperimmune-principal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hyperimmune-principal — 集合超免疫性与主函数不可支配"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a33ab576c20ae1c1\" href=\"?note=a33ab576c20ae1c1\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-set\">43-df-hyperimmune-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dae2ebe8bc9eb6b4\" href=\"?note=dae2ebe8bc9eb6b4\" title=\"43-df-principal-function\">43-df-principal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d5366face87e76fb\" href=\"?note=d5366face87e76fb\" title=\"43-df-domination\">43-df-domination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.14, argument around Lemma 5.14.4 and Theorem 5.14.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"59"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"79"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book-derived"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|=\\infty\">\\(|A|=\\infty\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_A\">\\(p_A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le^*\">\\(\\le^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dae2ebe8bc9eb6b4\" href=\"?note=dae2ebe8bc9eb6b4\" title=\"43-df-principal-function\">43-df-principal-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a33ab576c20ae1c1\" href=\"?note=a33ab576c20ae1c1\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-set\">43-df-hyperimmune-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d5366face87e76fb\" href=\"?note=d5366face87e76fb\" title=\"43-df-domination\">43-df-domination</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}(A)\\iff\\forall g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(g)\\Rightarrow p_A\\not\\le^*g\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}(A)\\iff\\forall g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(g)\\Rightarrow p_A\\not\\le^*g\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若强数组每项都遇到A，则前n+1项的并含至少n+1个A元素，其最大值给出p_A(n)的可计算上界。反向若p_A最终被可计算函数支配，调整有限个值并取递增上界g，使p_A(n)≤g(n)且g(n)≥n。取F_0=[0,g(0)]，递归令k=max F_i+1、F_{i+1}=[k,g(k)]；每项都含p_A(k)，构成反例强数组。这里修正了草稿证明中F_i与F_{i+1}的下标错排，并未推出“主函数可支配就使整个Turing度超免疫自由”。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，§5.14, argument around Lemma 5.14.4 and Theorem 5.14.5，印刷页59，PDF页79。本项为书内讨论的笔记内推导；未冒充原书逐字陈述。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-set","status":"resolved","id":"a33ab576c20ae1c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-principal-function","status":"resolved","id":"dae2ebe8bc9eb6b4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-principal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"d5366face87e76fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-domination]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-principal-function","status":"resolved","id":"dae2ebe8bc9eb6b4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $|A|=\\infty$。$p_A$、$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$、$\\le^*$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-principal-function]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]、[[43-df-domination]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-set","status":"resolved","id":"a33ab576c20ae1c1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $|A|=\\infty$。$p_A$、$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$、$\\le^*$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-principal-function]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]、[[43-df-domination]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"d5366face87e76fb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $|A|=\\infty$。$p_A$、$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$、$\\le^*$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-principal-function]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]、[[43-df-domination]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $|A|=\\infty$。$p_A$、$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$、$\\le^*$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-principal-function]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]、[[43-df-domination]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"|A|=\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"p_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}(A)\\iff\\forall g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(g)\\Rightarrow p_A\\not\\le^*g\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1912,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-hyperimmune-principal]] — 集合超免疫性与主函数不可支配"},{"id":"84509a9312e5b529","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · de